OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after Piccadilly
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services to, from and through
OL,7,FManchester Piccadilly have been
OL,8,Fcancelled or changed after a signalling
OL,9,Ffault blocked some lines.
OL,11,FNational Rail said the problem was
OL,12,Freported at 06:06 BST and disruption
OL,13,Fwas expected until 10:00.
OL,15,FAvanti West Coast said four services
OL,16,Fbetween Manchester and London Euston
OL,17,Fhad been cancelled because of the fault
OL,18,F- two trains in each direction.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
